'''Ritual Confusion''' (さらに召喚された福！, ''Sarani Shōkan Sareta Fuku!'', '''More Fortune Summoned!''') is the February [[Cat Capsule#Lucky Capsule G|Lucky Ticket G]] event in [[The Battle Cats]] and [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. The enemy introduced in this event is [[Lucky Dags]], a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Dagshund]]. This event was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]].

==Event==
Shut up and eat your sushi!<br>
During this event, take on dachshund-gone-bad Lucky Dags in new expert map {{Color|#FF0000|'''Ritual Confusion!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Available February 16th (11:00am) thru March 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Clear the stages to earn the coveted "Lucky Tickets G"! Head to the normal capsule and choose the Lucky Capsules G mode to use your rewards and pick up tons of XP and valuable special items! Later stages in "Ritual Confusion" will have a higher drop rate for more ticket rewards at once!

※"Ritual Confusion" is available once Empire of Cats Ch 3 has been cleared.<br>
※If stages for this event do not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Lucky Tickets G!'''}}<br>
Use rewards from "Another New Year" to earn Catamins and XP packs from a new normal capsule option!
Tap the button at the top of the Cat Capsules menu to select the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Capsules G'''}} option and draw using your {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Tickets G!'''}}

※ The Lucky Capsules G option will appear after you own at least one Lucky Ticket G.<br>
※ Lucky Tickets G owned will be held over for the next event even after the current Lucky Capsules G event ends.<br>
※ If the Lucky Capsules G do not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

